:"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"},{"quote":"In addition, e-IP users can also settle recurring annual fees associated with relevant investment products through the new system.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"},{"quote":"1 Investment-linked assurance schemes, mandatory provident fund products, open-ended fund companies, paper gold schemes, pooled retirement funds, real estate investment trusts, unit trusts and mutual funds and unlisted structured investment products.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"}],"distinction":"The strongest supported reading attaches the cutover to each submission event. For example, an IPD-administered fund's NAV report submitted on 30 November 2024 through the old system fails this selected route control, even if the fund was authorised earlier. A fee-only payment outside e-IP does not fail this control merely because of its route. The packet supports neither a general grandfathering alternative nor mandatory e-IP payment of annual fees; treating either as a competing rule would invent ambiguity. The strongest uncertainty concerns follow-up acts in pending cases and the event fixing their submission date.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the assessed event is an application or submission to IPD concerning an investment product administered by IPD, including applicable post-authorisation/registration reporting. Fee-only settlement does not itself establish this classification.","name":"is_covered_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u2.439","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528","d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Gregorian date of the assessed submission event; resolving which event fixes this date may require interpretation where transmission and receipt differ.","name":"submission_date","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"Whether the assessed application or submission was submitted to IPD via e-IP.","name":"submitted_via_eip","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"submitted_via_eip","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_covered_submission (>= submission_date (date 2024-11-30)))"},"local_id":"reading_1","questions":["For an existing case, which follow-up communications qualify as distinct applications or submissions subject to the cutover?","Do the unavailable referenced materials supply transition mechanics that affect event classification or timing?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected mandatory e-IP submission-route control, when scope is true, the result answers whether this submission used e-IP: true means the route requirement is met; false means it is not met. Outside scope, this control makes no compliance determination. Unknown facts remain unknown.","subject":"Mandatory e-IP route for an individual IPD investment-product application or submission from 30 November 2024"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.c581396e78d4072c6fc5ab0b","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.55785b1cbaaf47f384e91bd7ee5ca794","commitment":"cd46a315c9d7c7c7b2c8f3b787d49668cba6e42bf2643b7c89478d78f0a840a8","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_SCHEMA","details":"Invalid expression atom"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.cd46a315c9d7c7c7b2c8f3b7","order":3,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The Boolean result evaluates satisfaction of the stated mandatory e-IP submission condition for one identified application or submission.","A date on or after 30 November 2024 is within the full-adoption period described by the circular.","The assessed submission concerns an investment product administered by IPD.","The relevant act is an application or submission made on or after 30 November 2024.","“Via e-IP” means the submission was actually made through the e-IP system, rather than an existing channel."],"citations":[{"quote":"After the extended period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by the Investment Products Division (IPD)1 must be submitted to IPD via e-IP from 30 November 2024.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0"},{"quote":"Starting 30 November 2024, ie, after the parallel run period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by IPD must be submitted via e-IP.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"},{"quote":"During this period, the SFC continues to accept applications and submissions via existing channels.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737"}],"distinction":"This is a condition on the required submission route during the full-adoption period. It does not itself determine licence possession, legal compliance, or whether a submission is prohibited.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed item is an application or submission of an investment product.","name":"is_application_or_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of the assessed item"},{"meaning":"The investment product concerned is administered by the Investment Products Division (IPD).","name":"product_administered_by_ipd","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of product administration"},{"meaning":"Calendar date on which the assessed application or submission is made.","name":"submission_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"The assessed application or submission was made through e-IP.","name":"submitted_via_eip","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean fact about submission channel"},{"meaning":"The assessed application or submission was made through an existing non-e-IP channel.","name":"submitted_via_existing_channel","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean fact about submission channel"}],"result":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] (and is_application_or_submission product_administered_by_ipd (>= submission_date (date 2024-11-30)) submitted_via_eip)","result_type":"bool","scope":"For one identified application or submission, the result is true exactly when it is an application or submission concerning an IPD-administered investment product, made on or after 2024-11-30, and actually submitted via e-IP; false means at least one of those factual conditions is false. This result does not determine legal approval or overall compliance."},"local_id":"mandatory_eip_route_condition","questions":["Is the assessed item an application or submission of an investment product?","Is the investment product administered by IPD?","What is the submission date?","Was it submitted through e-IP, or through an existing channel?","Does any applicable exception alter the route requirement for this submission?","Identity of the submitting participant and investment product","Whether the particular product is administered by IPD","The date of the application or submission","Whether the submission was actually made through e-IP","Whether any source-defined exception applies to the particular submission"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The mandatory e-IP submission-route condition is satisfied for the assessed application or submission when the item is an IPD-administered investment-product application or submission made on or after 30 November 2024 and it was submitted via e-IP.","subject":"One application or submission of an investment product"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.cd46a315c9d7c7c7b2c8f3b7","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_i