products, open-ended fund companies, paper gold schemes, pooled retirement funds, real estate investment trusts, unit trusts and mutual funds and unlisted structured investment products.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"}],"distinction":"The prior models leave application/submission classification undifferentiated. The source separates mandatory applications and submissions, including operational reports migrating from IP E-submission, from the additional ability to pay recurring annual fees. A single transaction-channel Boolean could incorrectly make fee payment through e-IP mandatory or let an e-IP payment stand in for a report transmitted elsewhere. Assessment must follow each submission component. Scope is also separated from the result, avoiding the prior models' opposing treatment of out-of-scope items as false or vacuously true.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed component is an application or submission to IPD concerning an investment product, including an operational report responsive to the described IPD submission requests. A fee payment by itself does not satisfy this classification.","name":"is_application_or_submission_component","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u2.439","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of one component"},{"meaning":"The investment product concerned by the assessed component is administered by IPD, with product classification informed by footnote 1.","name":"product_administered_by_ipd","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528","d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean product classification"},{"meaning":"Calendar date on which this individual application or submission component is made to IPD.","name":"component_submission_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"This individual application or submission component was transmitted to IPD through e-IP. Payment of an associated fee through e-IP alone does not establish this fact.","name":"component_submitted_via_eip","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean transmission-channel fact"}],"result":"component_submitted_via_eip","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_application_or_submission_component product_administered_by_ipd (>= component_submission_date (date 2024-11-30)))"},"local_id":"component_specific_route_compliance","questions":["What individual application, report, other submission or fee-payment components comprise the assessed transaction?","Does the relevant product fall within the products administered by IPD?","On what date was the assessed application or submission component made to IPD?","Was that component actually submitted to IPD through e-IP?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For an application or submission component concerning an IPD-administered investment product made on or after 30 November 2024, does that component comply with the stated mandatory e-IP route? True means the component was submitted through e-IP; false means it was not. This result addresses only that route requirement, not fee-payment routing or overall legal compliance.","subject":"An individual application or submission component, including an operational report"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.d50a03d126c7018d3a9eef7e","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0}],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v1","retrievals":[],"rounds":0,"roundtrips":[],"run_id":"run.2847add700924b06b5ba677584ed1ed0","stop":null}